        "TileImage": "$($repository ab22f88d-f567-43a2-b20f-0ecc17257ffe).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47. Your mission, should you choose to accept it, is to frame Helmut Kruger for the murders of several targets at the Sanguine fashion show in Paris. Helmut must also be framed for his own murder. Good luck. This message will not self destruct as the ICA has already spent too much money on explosives for you this quarter.",
